<h2>This is makeup help, not medical advice</h2>
<p>For anything about your condition or medicines, ask your care team. An occupational therapist can suggest grips and tools that suit your hands.</p>

<h2>See the easy version on your own face</h2>
<p>Blendolo scores a look for your hands, swaps the hard steps and shows both versions on your photo, with big step cards read aloud.</p>
